  respirator: { n: 'Ammonia Respirator', c: '#5a6a5a', f: 'A half-mask respirator with two activated-carbon cartridges. Plain charcoal does not hold ammonia, so the carbon is soaked in an acid, here citric, that turns NH₃ into a salt it keeps' },
